{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/73c6e98d8f27ba9bc5e470a744871e93.webp?t=1758977781\" width=352 height=58 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Deckbuilding</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft &amp; Load your Backpack with Action-Items and Joker-Cards to create insane synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies can also have 'Joker'-Cards and use Action-Items from their Backpacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/6ee48d0a2c771001f6291ada3d2eebf8.poster.avif?t=1758977781\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/6ee48d0a2c771001f6291ada3d2eebf8.webm?t=1758977781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/6ee48d0a2c771001f6291ada3d2eebf8.mp4?t=1758977781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grid-based Tactics &amp; Telegraphed Attacks.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional Turn-based Tactics Movement/Prepare/Attack-system + additional use of your Backpack-Items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies Telegraphed Attacks preview their intended Actions and Attack-Order.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Crowd-Control effects such as Flip, Pin, Push, Pull, Provoke &amp; Mind-control or Place/Manipulate surrounding Objects/Terrain/Traps to dominate the Battle-Grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a party of multiple units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made a mistake? Rewind your Turn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying Fast-paced Turn Handling and QoL Features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/e1d730328c8f81e1b1d5678c6e442e0d.poster.avif?t=1758977781\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/e1d730328c8f81e1b1d5678c6e442e0d.webm?t=1758977781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/e1d730328c8f81e1b1d5678c6e442e0d.mp4?t=1758977781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Replayability &amp; Difficulty</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Crawling, Push-Your-Luck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proc-gen + Handcrafted Quest/Level-design as part of an overarching Event-system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta Progression: Unlock 30+ Companions by completing Achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode, Survival Mode &amp; PermaDeath.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the Town from impending Doom, Explore the Lands, Climb the Ascensions &amp; Meet the Master!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/ea973d97940e80e9284d512096d25f37.poster.avif?t=1758977781\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/ea973d97940e80e9284d512096d25f37.webm?t=1758977781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea